---
import { customConsultationHref } from "../../shared/custom-automation";
import "../styles/custom-automation.css";
---
<section class="custom-offer" id="custom-automation" aria-labelledby="custom-automation-heading">
  <div class="wrap custom-offer-grid">
    <div class="custom-offer-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Beyond the ten core solutions</p>
      <h2 id="custom-automation-heading">Different problem.<br /><span>Let's map the solution.</span></h2>
      <p class="custom-offer-lead">Have a workflow our core services do not cover? Request a custom automation consultation.</p>
      <p>We start with the process and the outcome you need. Feasibility, access, security and an approved scope determine what we can build.</p>
      <div class="custom-offer-actions"><a class="button" href={customConsultationHref}>Request a consultation <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/custom-automation/">Explore custom automation <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="custom-path-card" aria-label="A considered path from problem to software">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your process, considered</p>
      <ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>A business problem</h3><p>The repeated work, the friction and the people involved.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>A feasible software scope</h3><p>Authorized connections, clear boundaries and agreed acceptance checks.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>A tested next step</h3><p>Approved implementation, with human decisions and support defined.</p></div></li></ol>
      <p class="custom-path-note">Discovery comes first. No implementation is promised before feasibility and scope are agreed.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
